        "tooltip": "**Confirmed: portfolio-level concentration, and nobody computes it today.**\n\nDrawn dashed and named for what it is, because you want it sitting there looking unfinished rather than quietly reading as a stage that exists.\n\nIt is the only place in the design that could see the portfolio ending up on one side of a trade — your risk number is narrow by choice and never meets technicals or insider buying."
